<http://data.silknow.org/object/bee98899-6188-3cf1-b9cd-75769d8927e0/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Half of a Scarf which has been cut across the middle. Linen embroidered with silk in double darning on the diagonal and double running in a line.\nThe decoration is formed by pink blossoms with white centres, ragged blue blossoms, dark red tri-lobed flowers and smaller pink or green flowers which are packed together to form two right angled triangles with the slopes towards the centre.  This arrangment forms a 'V' shape of undecorated ground."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/bee98899-6188-3cf1-b9cd-75769d8927e0> .

